{"id":"8811191242063297","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-arithmetical-semantics.md","title":"Standard Arithmetical Satisfaction","display":"df-arithmetical-semantics — Standard Arithmetical Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-arithmetical-semantics","aliases":["89-df-arithmetical-semantics"],"display":"df-arithmetical-semantics — Standard Arithmetical Satisfaction","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]"],"created":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-arithmetical-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-arithmetical-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-arithmetical-semantics — Standard Arithmetical Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathsf V\\to\\omega\">\\(s:\\mathsf V\\to\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[x\\mapsto n]\">\\(s[x\\mapsto n]\\)</span> 是赋值更新。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\times\">\\(\\times\\)</span> 在项求值的右端为自然数加法乘法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 的右端联结词和量词处于元语言。句子真值使用全零赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_0\">\\(s_0\\)</span>。辅助变元取满足所列新鲜条件的最小指标；有界量词中的上界项不含其绑定变元。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{val}(v_i,s)&amp;\\coloneqq s(v_i),\\quad\\operatorname{val}(0,s)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}(St,s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(t,s)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(t+u,s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(t,s)+\\operatorname{val}(u,s),\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}(t\\times u,s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(t,s)\\times\\operatorname{val}(u,s),\\\\\n\\mathbb N,s\\models t=u&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(t,s)=\\operatorname{val}(u,s),\\\\\n\\mathbb N,s\\models\\neg A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathbb N,s\\models A),\\\\\n\\mathbb N,s\\models A\\lor B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathbb N,s\\models A)\\lor(\\mathbb N,s\\models B),\\\\\n\\mathbb N,s\\models\\forall x A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\mathbb N,s[x\\mapsto n]\\models A),\\\\\ns_0(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\mathbb N\\models S\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N,s_0\\models S\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\nt&lt;u&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists z\\ (t+Sz=u)\\quad(z\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u)),\\\\\nt\\le u&amp;\\coloneqq(t&lt;u)\\lor(t=u),\\quad t\\ge u\\coloneqq u\\le t,\\\\\n\\forall x&lt;t\\ A&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists x&lt;t\\ A\\coloneqq\\exists x(x&lt;t\\land A),\\\\\n\\exists!x\\ A&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\bigl(A\\land\\forall z(A[x:=z]\\to z=x)\\bigr)\n\\quad(z\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{val}(v_i,s)&amp;\\coloneqq s(v_i),\\quad\\operatorname{val}(0,s)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}(St,s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(t,s)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(t+u,s)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(t,s)+\\operatorname{val}(u,s),\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}(t\\times u,s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(t,s)\\times\\operatorname{val}(u,s),\\\\\n\\mathbb N,s\\models t=u&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(t,s)=\\operatorname{val}(u,s),\\\\\n\\mathbb N,s\\models\\neg A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathbb N,s\\models A),\\\\\n\\mathbb N,s\\models A\\lor B&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathbb N,s\\models A)\\lor(\\mathbb N,s\\models B),\\\\\n\\mathbb N,s\\models\\forall x A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\mathbb N,s[x\\mapsto n]\\models A),\\\\\ns_0(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\mathbb N\\models S\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N,s_0\\models S\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\nt&lt;u&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists z\\ (t+Sz=u)\\quad(z\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u)),\\\\\nt\\le u&amp;\\coloneqq(t&lt;u)\\lor(t=u),\\quad t\\ge u\\coloneqq u\\le t,\\\\\n\\forall x&lt;t\\ A&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists x&lt;t\\ A\\coloneqq\\exists x(x&lt;t\\land A),\\\\\n\\exists!x\\ A&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\bigl(A\\land\\forall z(A[x:=z]\\to z=x)\\bigr)\n\\quad(z\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>标准真值属于元语言递归关系，不是 PA 内部的全局真谓词。对象语言关系符号 &lt;、≤ 和唯一存在量词均为上式的定义性缩写。新引入的辅助变量每次取满足显示新鲜条件的最小指标变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s:\\mathsf V\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"s[x\\mapsto n]","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\times","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"s_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}arithmetical\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{val}(v_i,s)&\\coloneqq s(v_i),\\quad\\operatorname{val}(0,s)\\coloneqq0,\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}(St,s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(t,s)+1,\\\\\n\\operatorname{val}(t+u,s)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(t,s)+\\operatorname{val}(u,s),\\quad\n\\operatorname{val}(t\\times u,s)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{val}(t,s)\\times\\operatorname{val}(u,s),\\\\\n\\mathbb N,s\\models t=u&\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{val}(t,s)=\\operatorname{val}(u,s),\\\\\n\\mathbb N,s\\models\\neg A&\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg(\\mathbb N,s\\models A),\\\\\n\\mathbb N,s\\models A\\lor B&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\mathbb N,s\\models A)\\lor(\\mathbb N,s\\models B),\\\\\n\\mathbb N,s\\models\\forall x A&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (\\mathbb N,s[x\\mapsto n]\\models A),\\\\\ns_0(v_i)&\\coloneqq0,\\qquad\n\\mathbb N\\models S\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N,s_0\\models S\\quad(S\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\nt<u&\\coloneqq\\exists z\\ (t+Sz=u)\\quad(z\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u)),\\\\\nt\\le u&\\coloneqq(t<u)\\lor(t=u),\\quad t\\ge u\\coloneqq u\\le t,\\\\\n\\forall x<t\\ A&\\coloneqq\\forall x(x<t\\to A),\\quad\n\\exists x<t\\ A\\coloneqq\\exists x(x<t\\land A),\\\\\n\\exists!x\\ A&\\coloneqq\\exists x\\bigl(A\\land\\forall z(A[x:=z]\\to z=x)\\bigr)\n\\quad(z\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2344,"backlinks":[{"id":"8ab645f955c77848","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0ce064881a79d6f7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"995dd9138f5c3e5a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""